当班生产良率,
产线状态=运行中@(TextRGBA=(70,180,90,1),TextBackRGBA=(235,245,238,1))||维护中@(TextRGBA=(250,190,50,1),TextBackRGBA=(255,247,239,1))||空闲@(TextRGBA=(140,140,140,1),TextBackRGBA=(245,245,245,1))||报警中@(TextRGBA=(220,60,60,1),TextBackRGBA=(248,240,240,1))
}
